    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd228691096fbe7e971b9af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的语气听起来和平常不同，\n措辞很明显带有攻击意图……\n看来她与她的母亲之间似乎有不小的鸿沟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd4c3361a99e5898c760b807a46e3c91792ca15233ab004551fb7aed59d4869f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
