    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b55baa37c40150763733ec0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也不记得上次好好跟她说话是什么时候了。\n傻子也看得出来她不接受我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe87e4f0d9820f69177b664b28026a572c751d6124c40c2505509b0a4e7870d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
