    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22187b11a388f93e52ef9000",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……一开始是她先抛出一句“我不明白”。\n那就什么都不用说了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b97a1ab47aa777229e8bb29bc9a1cc163ef0494724f5045eba02bfd1533be4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87af4ec0d2922d4b5f1abc7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我突然想到，她妈妈寄来的东西之所以那么杂……\n会不会是因为不知道她需要什么，\n所以拼命想了又想，才送了那些东西来？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfb27f7d69b5f81e891358bbc3e5e00408b2eb47ec1bb1e6e6668ce9dcb374f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3877ae40f0059eb1a5dea07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可能她真的是不明白……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca66719e2234d75c0861da2e58d54a421771b75305e3e8a50767515d9a91b58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
