    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17bc41d65a20318da474b56c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“希望你能明白我的心情”──\n寻求理解的这段话，或许隐含着\n希望能有机会与她说话的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39021906a927cd28559f9df87585950f006e20689c176e05be50090198e1d3ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
