    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22ed630db86fdf759b4a59c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听起来她的母亲以前曾是歌手。\n虽然很好奇细节，\n不过她看起来似乎不想再谈下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c030d7a28d9da61381861cf78e1bdc8cf19d46995e350f553a1c041246b284a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
