      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我又看了一次照片，\n发现空中神宫的母亲长相很甜美，\n而空中神宫从这时起，就已经有种冷傲的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3afb838abc93e14f153b680d61ab77299f09420185b194d18a1bb67aa637b983",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
