      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be9315d76cc2ca72e46b26c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也不知道为什么，当时的箱子里装了超辣点心，\n那家伙二话不说就吃了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b67f6fc1302a6d74f4993da2101fa8730ecaa340ce095491999071332c9cb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2a8a87654b68d9296fc12d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而箱子里面──真的是“什么都有”。\n原本我还以为里头都是些垃圾零食，\n却发现也有看似有益健康的有机食品……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0486edd2acba84697944ce027a2d65c0f72f2858feec680a8c8432648679ec5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71f7308183cb81f28c582d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫",
      "source_fingerprint": "518141f549ec17c68539558e989d6e1e1572a826491709a731c97a2fe4f1603f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48ba71385fe483fe3f6f1779",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来她一直跟我道歉，还变得很沮丧。\n这样跟她待在同个房间不是很烦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47efb3a3de2d1188e9e3a044fa9039c4b00ca5df17598ac8523ad39ef6220521",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065637ceff9388d96a800809",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫",
      "source_fingerprint": "518141f549ec17c68539558e989d6e1e1572a826491709a731c97a2fe4f1603f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
