    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e98b55a9987b64fd4f568b66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来这种事对她来说算是家常便饭吧。\n名将怒涛为什么会喜欢亲近空中神宫……\n我觉得自己似乎发现了一部分原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7a6ad2903e4cd5a41769e0e262c05f07072fa7d6514e33e59bf8e7614807ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84c5f03c1c8588758e4044df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "照片……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "756fb0919142445944398bd296795c14a2e6acd47ceaa17200a170b7b8a02480",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "choice_data_list",
