    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab19e26c4c8e64132382939",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──没错。\n这全都是我老妈寄来的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f16308961afccde826125f8411c92be4620c5a417f70f48b553f9091bf8a6ea7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11952d8c3d679a799779a5ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，我因为好奇而去问空中神宫，\n她很干脆地承认是家人寄来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c9ea029d5a250bc381d9bfb9de5a2b1a3c38cd153ffa961642f131f73dbbfbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036514.json",
      "json_path": [
